    <item>
      <title>多莉帕顿比每一个愚蠢的金发笑话都聪明</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/style/dolly-parton-jokes-humor-image.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[与她对自己的评价相比，评论家或喜剧演员对帕顿的评价——而且他们说了很多——没有任何评价。她踩到了他们的妙语，夺走了他们的权力。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/style/dolly-parton-jokes-humor-image.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 19:39:38 GMT</pubDate>
