    <item>
      <title>Meta 将就社交媒体成瘾索赔支付高达 171 亿美元的里程碑式和解金</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/technology/meta-settlement-social-media-addiction-lawsuit.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这家社交媒体巨头与 47 个州、哥伦比亚特区和美国领土达成和解，并同意对其产品进行重大更改，因为其平台声称其平台危及儿童。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/technology/meta-settlement-social-media-addiction-lawsuit.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:55:31 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>科学家表示，尼泊尔致命洪水可能是由“冰崩”引起的</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/world/asia/nepal-flood-glacier-ice-avalanche.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[对卫星图像的初步评估表明，高海拔冰川的“冰雪崩”将巨大的瀑布送入下面的山谷。]]></description>
