      <title>超过100名印度朝圣者在尼泊尔洪水中失踪</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/world/asia/over-100-indian-pilgrims-are-among-the-missing-in-deadly-nepal-floods.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[他们中的许多人是往返于喜马拉雅山峰，这座山峰被印度教徒尊为湿婆神的精神家园。]]></description>
